prompt_template:
You are given one frozen benchmark task. Return exactly one JSON object and nothing else. The JSON object must contain: task_id, runner, provider, model, model_version, raw_response_id, raw_response_api, runtime_seconds, token_usage, validation_commands, validation_results, predicted_flags, predicted_provider_state, evidence_citations, abstentions. Use only the provided frozen task_id, task files, and source-manifest contents. Do not use FlagShark internals, goldens, hidden notes, or network access. If provenance is incomplete, return an empty predicted_flags array and an explicit abstention.

TASK_ID: {{task_id}}
SOURCE_MANIFEST: {{source_manifest}}
SOURCE_ROOT: {{source_root}}
SNAPSHOT_ID: {{repo_snapshot_id}}
SOURCE_REVISION: {{source_revision}}
FILES:
{{files}}
